  "priorExpiration": "2004-12-22",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2106.01 Appeal. Pursuant to RSA 159:6-c, any person whose license to carry a loaded pistol or revolver has been denied may appeal to the Concord District Court within 30 days of the denial, suspension, or revocation.\n\nSource. #6269, eff 6-25-96; ss by #8104, INTERIM, eff 6-25-04, EXPIRES: 12-22-04; ss by #8189, eff 10-15-04; ss by #10380, eff 7-17-13; ss by #13881, eff 2-20-24\n\nAPPENDIX",
